# **And the winners are.....[![mother africa competition](/media/2014/05/mother-africa-competition1.jpg)](/media/2014/05/mother-africa-competition1.jpg)**

Thanks to the team of Mother Africa @ QPAC for providing us with these wonderful tickets. Congratulations to AMA KALMA & ANNA LEE. You have  just won a double pass each to see Mother Africa on May 15th @ QPAC in Brisbane! Now, all you have to do is choose a friend! Enjoy your awesome prize worth  over $120 each! Have fun and thanks for subscribing to Rhythm Culture :)
